+# TASK-260715-gyg51r revision 4 review verdict
+
+Verdict: **accepted** for `CR-TASK-260715-gyg51r-4` revision 4.
+
+The exact candidate tree is
+`82c5b2ce942d3d676a035c559ab80d54aa7ea05d`. All five working files match
